  "details": "Spawning a \"complicated\" object causes the person spawning the object to freeze for a long duration. Comparing hitch time with another user, this may be related to the number of object syncs within the object. \n\nsample world:\nwrld_a03077de-aad0-4006-958d-a6546d9210fa\n\nThere is only one interact which is the lever. Clicking it will spawn a \"complicated\" object. On live, there is a small hitch, but on open beta it will freeze for 15 seconds.\n\nStats for the spawned object:\n604 total objects\n122 Triggers\n337 Trigger events\n5 Object syncs\n\nThis object spawned from a reference in the scene and not a prefab.\n\nRelated canny\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/845-spawning-a-complicated-object-breaks-broadcasting-within-the-spawned-object",
